  "applies_to": "Caleffi CONTECA EASY 750 series heat meters connected to BACnet through the Caleffi gateway code 755052.",
  "summary": "CONTECA EASY 750 is a heating and cooling energy meter. Through the Caleffi 755052 gateway it appears on BACnet MS/TP or BACnet IP as read-only Analog Inputs for heating and cooling energy, four pulse inputs (e.g. hot and cold water meters), power, flow, flow and return temperatures and an alarm/status word. Every value is mapped twice: AI 1-14 in SI units and AI 15-28 in imperial units.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet MS/TP",
    "BACnet IP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "The guide prints no read/write column; all objects are meter readings and are listed read-only.",
    "AI 1-14 are SI units; AI 15-28 repeat them in imperial units.",
    "Alarm/Status is a bit word: T flow/return errors, no flow, valve internal leakage, battery error, no credit, measurement unit errors C0-C4.",
    "Pulse inputs 1 and 2 are labelled DHW and DCW; inputs 3 and 4 can count volume or energy."
  ],
