    "setup": [
      "The gateway (a ProtoNode FPC-N54) ships with fixed Caleffi profiles; pick the profile and the device's Modbus Node-ID in its web configurator (default IP 192.168.1.24, user admin, password on the gateway label).",
      "The BACnet device instance is derived from the Modbus Node-ID (1-255), which must be unique per device.",
      "Serves BACnet MS/TP or BACnet IP; set Virtual Server Nodes to Yes when several devices share one gateway.",
      "Meter Modbus port: 9600 baud, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit, parity Even (factory default) or None."
